#
#===============================================================================
#  FUNCTION OVERVIEW:
#
#    - build_tree(name, structure)
#         Builds a virtual DOM tree.
#
#    - diff(old, new)
#         Computes patches between two VDOM trees.
#
#    - apply_patches(tree, patches)
#         Applies patches to an existing tree.
#
#    - render(name, new_structure)
#         Full render pipeline: build → diff → patch.
#
#===============================================================================
#  VIRTUAL NODE FORMAT:
#
#    {
#      "tag": "div",
#      "props": { "class": "header" },
#      "children": [ ... ]
